==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{der|sh|sla-pro|*raditi}}. Cognate with {{cog|bg|радея|t=care for}}, {{cog|ru|радеть|t=care for}}. Non-Slavic cognates include {{cog|os|рад|t=order}}, {{cog|sa|राध्यते}}, {{m|sa|राधति}} and {{m|sa|राध्नोति|tr=rādhnóti|t=succeed}}, {{cog|got|𐌲𐌰𐍂𐌴𐌳𐌰𐌽}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sh|/rǎːditi/}}
* {{hyph|sh|ra|di|ti}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=ráditi|a=impf}}

# {{lb|sh|intransitive}} to [[work]]
#: {{uxi|sh|Ne mogu da dođem sutra, '''radiću''' do kasno u noć!|I can't come tomorrow, I'll be working late into the night}}
#: {{uxi|sh|Ne mogu doći sutra, '''radit ću''' do kasno u noć!|I can't come tomorrow, I'll be working late into the night}}
# {{lb|sh|transitive}} to [[do]], [[act]]
#: {{uxi|sh|Što/Šta '''radiš''' sutra?|What are you doing tomorrow?}}
# {{lb|sh|reflexive}} to [[concern]], [[be]] about
#: {{uxi|sh|O čemu se ovd(j)e '''radi'''?|What is this about?|lit=What does it here work itself about?}}

